namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetPlacement {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidgetPlacement.h#DreamWidgetPlacement
    src   "Everything about where a widget sits that is destroyed by reparenting it, captured so it can be\nput back.\n\nThis exists because of one detail of how parenting works here: detaching a widget DESTROYS its\npanel slot, and re-attaching creates a fresh default one. So a widget lifted out to a drag layer\nand dropped back does not merely need its parent and sibling index restored -- it needs every\nauthored slot property restored too, or padding, alignment, fill weight, grid placement and\nauto-size all silently reset to defaults. That is the failure that looks like \"my layout broke\nitself when I dragged something\", and it is not obvious from the API that it can happen.\n\nAnything that temporarily moves a widget needs this: drag and drop, a reorder preview, a\nfull-screen zoom of a card, an item flying to an inventory slot. It is deliberately not part of\nthe drag system, because the need is \"move this somewhere and put it back\" and not \"drag\"."
    text  "控件的摆放位置中所有会因重新指定父项而被销毁的信息，在此捕获以便之后能\n还原。\n\n之所以需要它，是因为这里的父子关系实现有一个细节：分离控件会销毁它的\n面板插槽，而重新附加会创建一个全新的默认插槽。因此，把控件取出到拖拽层\n再放回时，不仅需要恢复它的父项和同级索引，还需要恢复每一个\n编辑过的插槽属性，否则内边距、对齐、填充权重、网格位置和\n自动尺寸都会静默重置为默认值。这种故障看起来就像“我拖了一下，布局就自己坏了”，\n而从 API 上并不容易看出会发生这种事。\n\n任何会临时移动控件的功能都需要它：拖放、重排预览、卡片的\n整屏缩放、物品飞入物品栏插槽。它有意不属于\n拖拽系统，因为这里的需要是“把控件移到某处再放回去”，而不是“拖拽”。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetPlacement:bHadSlot {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidgetPlacement.h#DreamWidgetPlacement:bHadSlot
    src   "False when the widget had no panel slot, so Restore does not fabricate one."
    text  "当控件没有面板插槽时为 false，这样 Restore 就不会凭空创建一个。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetPlacement:SlotMinDesiredSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamWidgetPlacement.h#DreamWidgetPlacement:SlotMinDesiredSize
    src   "The rest of the slot. These were missing rather than deliberately dropped: the struct's whole\nreason for existing is that a detach destroys the slot, and a per-slot minimum or a wrap-box line\nbreak is exactly as authored as the padding next to it."
    text  "槽的其余部分。这些是遗漏的，而不是有意丢弃的：这个结构体存在的全部\n理由就是分离会销毁槽，而每槽最小值或 WrapBox 换行\n和旁边的内边距一样，都是作者明确设置的。"
    state machine
}
